============================
*httk* quickstart: databases
============================

Create database file, store a structure in it, and retrive it
-------------------------------------------------------------

*httk-data* provides relational storage and querying over SQLite and DuckDB.
See the `database documentation <https://docs.httk.org/httk-data/>`__.

Create database file and store your own data in it
--------------------------------------------------

The storage API accepts ordinary frozen dataclasses. See the
`database documentation <https://docs.httk.org/httk-data/>`__.
